resources.string:
Bayan ka kwafa ko ka zaɓi rubutu (a cikin kowane manhaja), zanen “Fassara” zai bayyana a saman dama na allo; danna shi don yin fassara, sannan sakamakon zai bayyana a cikin taga. 

 Matakan da dole ne a bi: 
 1. Ba da izinin “Nuna a kan wasu manhajoji” (zango mai shawagi); 
 2. A kunna hidimar sauƙin amfani ta wannan manhaja (itace kaɗai hanyar da Android 10+ ke amfani da ita don karanta alƙalamin bayan gaba); 
 3. A ba wannan manhaja izini a cikin tsarin ta kunna da kanta, sannan a kashe ingantawar batiri don hana a kashe hidimar.
